OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein may set back unity by
OL,4,Aaligning with UK parties, taoiseach
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FSinn Fein may "set back unity" by
OL,8,Faligning with the nationalist leaders
OL,9,Fin Britain according to the Taoiseach
OL,10,F(Irish Prime Minister) Micheal Martin.
OL,12,FIt comes after Sinn Fein leader Mary
OL,13,FLou McDonald and deputy leader Michelle
OL,14,FO'Neill, SNP leader John Swinney and
OL,15,FPlaid Cymru leader Rhun ap Iorwerth met
OL,16,Fin Cardiff on Monday.
OL,18,FThe group met in their capacity as
OL,19,Fparty leaders, rather than as officials
OL,20,Fin their respective governments.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
